	SNA			/ IF AC=0, NO TWO WHEEL
	JMP	PRNT1		/ JUMP TO HANDLE REGULAR PRINTING
	SMA CLA
	CML			/ SECOND PASS--CM LINK AND TWO CASES
				/ BECOME IDENTICAL
	SNL			/ SKIP IF WE DON'T NEED TO PRINT THIS PASS/C116
	JMP	PRNT1		/ TW MODE, PRINTING

/***********************************************************************/
/									/
/	PRMTWN--TWO WHEEL, NOT PRINTING					/
/		A SECTION OF CODE ADDED TO SPEED UP TWO WHEEL		/
/		PRINTING IN THE MONOSPACE CASE (NOT THEME OR		/
/		PROPORTIONAL MODE)					/
