/LINK COULD BE CLOBBERED IN THESE ROUTINES...
	RAL			/ GET HIT COUNT
	TAD	PRQOVP		/ ADD IN THE DARKNESS VALUE
	DCA	NEWHIT		/ SAVE AS NEW BOLD MODE			/A046
	TAD	NEWHIT		/ GET IT BACK				/A046
