/		JUSTIFYING THIS LINE THEN PRTWDP MAY OR MAY NOT		/
/		BE ZERO DEPENDING ON HOW THE JUSTIFICATION ALGORTHM	/
/		CAME OUT.  IF PRTWHC IS ZERO THEN PRTWDP IS ZERO.	/
/									/
